   158	## 6. Lemma 2.3 and the unbounded parameter
   159	
   160	### 6.1 Conditional summation
   161	
   162	**Verdict: CONFIRMED WITH A NOTATIONAL CORRECTION.** Assume (D1)--(D4), the generic identity (2.3) for every `B_i`, and the companion bounds
   163	
   164	```text
   165	1 <= f(B_i) <= u_i,       u_i=2 on T211, u_i=1 on T31.
