   169	
   170	The sets of lines mapping onto distinct `B_i` are disjoint. Orevkov's equality therefore reads exactly
   171	
   172	```text
   173	3 = sum_i(4-f(B_i)) + E + Corr,
   174	```
   175	
   176	where `E>=0` is the sum of base multiplicities of dicritical lines mapping to components of `A_F` outside `B`, and `Corr>=0` is the correction sum. Charged line 107 omits `E` while calling the remainder only “corr”; folding `E` into a newly defined nonnegative remainder repairs the display. Since `4-f(B_i)>=2` for every component (and at least `3` on `T31`),
