+
+```text
+f(B_i) := #(pi^{-1}(z) cap U) >= 1
+```
+
+for generic `z in B_i` is genuinely promoted where the packet says it is. It should remain explicit in Lemma 2.3 consumers; it is a floor, not an attainment statement.
